Cocopay is a fintech/banking-style web app with user wallet, deposits, withdrawals, transfers, billing, admin controls, and support tools.

**User Features**
- User registration and login
- Email/SMS OTP verification
- Password reset
- User dashboard
- Wallet balance tracking
- Deposit money through gateways
- Manual deposit support
- Paystack deposit support
- Monnify deposit support
- Withdraw from wallet
- Manual withdrawal
- Automatic withdrawal support
- Bank list lookup
- Nigerian bank account name resolution
- Transfer between users
- Other-bank transfer/beneficiary flow
- Transaction history
- Deposit history
- Withdrawal history
- KYC submission
- Profile management
- Support ticket creation/replies
- Referral commission support

**Money Movement**
- Wallet debit/credit ledger
